WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:16.644
A train sped along the tracks outside Metro City.

2
00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:22.153
The train was carrying several animals from Metro City Zoo.

3
00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:26.525
"This will be an exciting zoo tour," said the train's engineer.

4
00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.899
"That's right," said the conductor.

5
00:00:28.899 --> 00:00:34.057
"Lots of people will get to see the special animals from the zoo."

6
00:00:34.057 --> 00:00:37.805
"People will really love Blue Baboon," said the engineer.

7
00:00:37.806 --> 00:00:41.889
"He's everybody's favorite—Oh no!

8
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.890
Another train is coming!"

9
00:00:44.891 --> 00:00:48.687
Crash!

10
00:00:48.688 --> 00:00:51.822
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Zoo.

11
00:00:51.823 --> 00:00:54.547
They were standing in front of the baboon exhibit.

12
00:00:54.547 --> 00:00:57.878
Roxy saw a small hill and lots of trees.

13
00:00:57.878 --> 00:01:01.369
But there was no baboon.

14
00:01:01.369 --> 00:01:06.664
"Blue Baboon left for the zoo tour today," said Mara.

15
00:01:06.664 --> 00:01:09.245
"I miss him already!"

16
00:01:09.245 --> 00:01:11.968
"Me too," said Terrell.

17
00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:14.213
"I hope he comes back soon.

18
00:01:14.213 --> 00:01:18.455
The zoo isn't much fun without him."

19
00:01:18.456 --> 00:01:21.541
The four friends walked through the bird exhibit.

20
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:26.797
"The zoo still has lots of cool animals," said Roxy.

21
00:01:26.797 --> 00:01:29.368
She pointed at a brightly colored parrot.

22
00:01:29.368 --> 00:01:32.638
"I really like Parrot Pete."

23
00:01:32.638 --> 00:01:35.378
"Hello," said Parrot Pete.

24
00:01:35.378 --> 00:01:41.045
Roxy giggled. "Hello!"

25
00:01:41.045 --> 00:01:45.791
"Cool!" said Jack. "I see vultures!"

26
00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:50.080
Mara sighed. "All these birds are great.

27
00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.797
But Blue Baboon is my favorite animal."

28
00:01:53.797 --> 00:01:56.649
"Mine too," said Terrell.

29
00:01:56.649 --> 00:02:00.724
Jack shrugged. "He'll be back in a few months."

30
00:02:00.724 --> 00:02:03.410
Terrell's eyes suddenly lit up.

31
00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.912
"I have a great idea!" he said.

32
00:02:05.912 --> 00:02:11.032
"We can ask Rocket Girl to fly Blue Baboon home for visits!"

33
00:02:11.032 --> 00:02:13.464
"That would be awesome!"

34
00:02:13.464 --> 00:02:16.081
Mara pumped her fist in the air.

35
00:02:16.082 --> 00:02:19.622
"Then we wouldn't have to miss Blue Baboon at all!"

36
00:02:19.623 --> 00:02:21.793
Roxy rolled her eyes.

37
00:02:21.793 --> 00:02:25.617
"I doubt Rocket Girl can do that, Terrell."

38
00:02:25.617 --> 00:02:27.934
"Why not?" asked Terrell.

39
00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:30.367
"She can fly really fast!"

40
00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:32.812
"That's true," said Roxy.

41
00:02:32.812 --> 00:02:36.367
"But Rocket Girl isn't a taxi service.

42
00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:39.314
She has more important things to do."

43
00:02:39.314 --> 00:02:46.041
Terrell nodded. "Yeah, you're probably right."

44
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:48.758
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

45
00:02:48.758 --> 00:02:53.609
She stepped away from her friends.

46
00:02:53.724 --> 00:02:58.215
She made sure they weren't looking and then pressed a button on the watch.

47
00:02:58.215 --> 00:03:00.730
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

48
00:03:00.731 --> 00:03:02.714
He looked shocked.

49
00:03:02.714 --> 00:03:05.005
"Rocket Girl!" said the mayor.

50
00:03:05.005 --> 00:03:07.713
"There's been a terrible train crash!"

51
00:03:07.713 --> 00:03:10.087
"Oh no!" said Roxy.

52
00:03:10.087 --> 00:03:12.080
"Where did it happen?"

53
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.526
"Just outside Metro City," said Mayor Bloom.

54
00:03:15.527 --> 00:03:19.541
"The train carrying the zoo animals crashed into another train.

55
00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:22.902
The second train was loaded with dangerous chemicals.

56
00:03:22.903 --> 00:03:25.446
I think we need your help!"

57
00:03:25.446 --> 00:03:27.015
Roxy gulped.

58
00:03:27.015 --> 00:03:33.202
"Don't worry, Mayor. I'm on my way!"
